      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAVERS GINNY (5) hit the ground running off the inside draw with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 0.6 lengths fifth (17.12) over 300m at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Should be very hard to beat this time. WINNALEAH (7) has been out of the placings at her last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (17.20) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track. Can find the frame this time. TSU'TEY (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Warragul over 400m behind Memphis Mack (23.47) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Should be in this for a long way. MY BOY SONNY (1) can measure up with the right run.",
